Package: teslatlas-hub
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, systemd@RUNTIME_DEPENDS@
Maintainer: Magrathean UK Ltd <contact@magrathean.uk>
Description: Self-hosted Tesla telemetry hub
 Teslatlas Hub is a local one-vehicle telemetry collector, migration tool,
 sync server, and command-line controller.
